-- title:
--   Full original BV physical compact C1 jump kernel integrable on the original global marked Lévy measure
-- statement:
--   For the original BV process and admissible dividend strategy, the actual stopped and discounted compact C1 negative-mark kernel is globally integrable with respect to the same original Lévy marked jump measure. It imports the original intrinsic finite-horizon kernel integrability and the exact global-to-physical absolute integral transfer; its proof establishes the original left-reserve measurability and finite-clock support without a substitute process. Via the separately accepted full H-to-physical kernel equality it discharges the source-specific Integrable(H NX) hypothesis of the completed finite physical-cell compensation identity.

